Algorithms for Unsorted Data

   Linear Search (Sequential Search)

Algorithms for Sorted Data

   Binary Search (divided into 2 repeated)
   Ternary Search (divided into 3 repeated)
   Jump Search (jump fixed alus then linear)
   Interpolation Search (binary but estimates)
   Exponential Search (doubles index then binary)
   Fibonacci Search (binary but fibonacci intervals)

Tree and Graph Searches

   Breadth-First Search (BFS) (Queue)
   Depth-First Search (DFS) (Stack)

String/Text Searches:

   Knuth-Morris-Pratt (KMP) (substring with larger tring, doesn't repeat)
   Rabin-Karp (hashing to find subtring in large text body)